1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The same event should not become the same memory for everyone.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Umi, Mahiru, and Maomao would each carry it differently.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The event is objective. The residue is subjective.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
That is the next memory problem I want Underworld to solve.
